  "description": "<h1 data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"178\">Nintendo Switch Game – LEGO Harry Potter Collection | ZGAN | €19,99</h1>\r\n<p data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"488\">Beleef de complete <strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"225\">Harry Potter-avonturen</strong> in LEGO-stijl met de <strong data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"279\">LEGO Harry Potter Collection</strong> voor de Nintendo Switch. Speel alle jaren uit de bekende films in één game, vol humor, puzzels en actie.<br data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"387\">Dit exemplaar verkeert in <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"441\">ZGAN (zo goed als nieuw)</strong> staat, is volledig getest en direct speelbaar.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"493\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"511\">Specificaties</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n<li data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"551\">\r\n<p data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"551\">Titel: LEGO Harry Potter Collection</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"581\">\r\n<p data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"581\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"619\">\r\n<p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"619\">Genre: Avontuur / Familie / Actie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<p data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"638\">Toestand: ZGAN</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"691\">\r\n<p data-start=\"641\" data-end=\"691\">Inclusief: Originele game (doos indien aanwezig)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"728\">\r\n<p data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"728\">Speelbaar: Singleplayer en co-op</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"733\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"747\">Voordelen</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<li data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"797\">Complete Harry Potter-verhaallijn in één game</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"827\">Geschikt voor jong en oud</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"865\">\r\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"865\">Leuk om alleen of samen te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"888\">\r\n<p data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"888\">Direct plug & play</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"893\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"903\">Prijs</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"912\">€19,99</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"917\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"942\">Ophalen of Verzenden</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<li data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"988\">\r\n<p data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"988\">Afhalen bij <strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"986\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1045\">Verzending mogelijk, veilig verpakt en snel geleverd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
